# Intentional API changes since the latest release, accepted by tests/api_compat.sh.
# One line per difference, as reported by the test after "only in vX.Y.Z: ", e.g.
#   macro: XXH_SOME_MACRO
#   declaration: <declaration, as reported>
# Declarations are written as preprocessed by the compiler of CI (gcc).
# Changes must be deliberate, and mentioned in CHANGELOG.
# This list is emptied when a new release becomes the reference.
